hidden-text.ttf

A subset of Amiri Regular (Copyright 2010-2022 The Amiri Project Authors,
https://github.com/aliftype/amiri), licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
(https://openfontlicense.org). Kept: Basic Latin, Latin-1, the Arabic and Arabic Supplement blocks
and a few punctuation marks; removed: every other character, the shaping tables and the hinting.
The family name was changed to "GetOCR Hidden Text".

It carries the invisible text of a searchable PDF where that text is in Jawi. Nothing is drawn
with it. The subset is licensed under the same Open Font License.

hidden-text-tamil.ttf, hidden-text-thai.ttf

Subsets of Noto Sans Tamil and Noto Sans Thai at their default weight and width (Copyright 2022
The Noto Project Authors, https://github.com/notofonts/tamil and https://github.com/notofonts/thai),
licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. Kept: Basic Latin and the Tamil or Thai
block; removed: everything else, the shaping tables and the hinting. The family names were changed
to "GetOCR Hidden Text Tamil" and "GetOCR Hidden Text Thai". Same use and same licence as above.
